<HelloFraandsPage title="Rates, payouts & taxes" summary="Har minute ki kamaai aur payout ka hisaab samjhein.">
<p>Influencers set the per-minute price their fans pay, after full video KYC and administrator approval. Fans are charged per minute at the rate the influencer sets.</p>
<h2>Influencer earnings at your own rate</h2><p>Earnings are paid by the minute, only for connected time. Ringing, missed calls and calls that do not connect earn ₹0. You choose a whole-rupee fan price from ₹5 to ₹1,000 per minute. Your earnings are 60% of the connected-call charge, minus ₹2.00 for each connected minute to cover the telephone call. The platform keeps 40%; GST on that platform share is absorbed by the platform and is not added to the fan's price or deducted again from you.</p>
<p>Example at ₹20 per minute for a one-minute connected call: the fan pays ₹20, your earning is ₹10, ₹2 covers the call, and the platform share is ₹8.</p>
<h2>Payouts</h2><p>Your earnings and their payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. New earnings are held for 7 days. The minimum payout is ₹500. Each payout is approved by our team and sent to a bank account or UPI ID in your own name.</p>
<h2>Taxes need final review</h2><p>PAN, TDS, GST treatment and the influencer earnings statement must be confirmed and disclosed before payouts launch. Tax obligations depend on each influencer's circumstances; seek independent tax advice if needed.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
